{
  "brief_rationale": "Trajectory covers 16 turns and comprehensively addresses all seven responsibility-chain items with no serious or minor error. The model actively triggered and completed HO2 (privacy-sensitive symptom discovery) and HO3 (real-world navigation for fragmented reports), and meaningfully completed HO1 (non-alarming communication) and HO4 (repair of self-medication risk). No important non-chain defect is present. Closure is valid, safe, executable, and traceable with teach-back confirmation.",
