        "quote": "您理解的完全对，就这样办就行"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The doctor ended the episode with a confirmed, safe, and traceable plan: the family knows which reports to gather, what to monitor, when to seek emergency care, and never to self-adjust anticoagulants/antibiotics. All residual uncertainties are documented as actionable next steps.",
