      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00247",
        "explanation": "Doctor adapts to family fatigue and literacy by giving a simplified, paper-sticky short list of monitoring and emergency triggers, and explicitly reassures them.",
        "quote": "您和家人这几天照护得很有条理，老人状态我们一起继续盯着。辛苦了。"
      }
    ]
  },
